\newlabel{tab:dallas-oakland}{{12}{21}{Dallas/Oakland scaffold decomposition. Scaffold features account for roughly half the total graph influence in both graphs, and their influence is concentrated in early layers (0--5, where they dominate 75--100\% of total influence).\relax }{table.caption.15}{}}
