\newlabel{tab:scaffold-domain}{{13}{21}{Per-domain scaffold metrics. ``Scaffold influence'' is the fraction of total graph influence carried by scaffold features; ``Shared\%'' is the fraction of features (by count, not influence) that are scaffold; ``Early'' and ``Late'' are the same quantity restricted to layers $\leq L_5$ and $\geq L_{16}$ respectively.\relax }{table.caption.16}{}}
